        /// <br/>If the new offering has a lower seat count than the seats currently used in the entitlement,
        /// <br/>it will fail unless the 'forceSeatCount' query string parameter is set to true.
        /// <br/>If the seat count or overdraft settings were manually edited before, they will not be changed by this method.
